SHARED DIM counter and map persist safely across HTTP requests (Requirement 14.4).

### first hit
POST /hit
=> 200

{"hits": 1}

### second hit
POST /hit
=> 200

{"hits": 2}

### read hits
GET /hit
=> 200

{"hits": 2}

### store note in shared map
POST /note/greeting
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": "READY."}
=> 200

{"ok": true}

### read note from shared map
GET /note/greeting
=> 200

{"value": "READY."}
